Status B in the 27.2 layout (diff item 8): the firmware-control pointers,
recovery info, slot mask, recovery state and host recovery words 0x1e0 later
(macOS 27.2 has the firmware-control pointers at +0x4ac0/+0x4ac8 from its
InitData message; the driver wrote them at +0x48e0), and +0xe714 = 1.

